            "needId": "checklist:2",
            "type": "checklist",
            "heading": "English Test a Few",
            "kind": "items",
            "items": [
              {
                "heading": "",
                "text": "English test: a few sources mention the Versant test."
              },
              {
                "heading": "",
                "text": "Voice is harder to enter than non-voice if your spoken English is weak."
              },
              {
                "heading": "",
                "text": "College spending: BPO needs no costly degree."
              },
              {
                "heading": "",
                "text": "Degree later: an open or distance degree done beside work keeps manager and KPO doors open."
              }
            ],
            "sourceSectionId": "entry",
            "sourceNeedIndex": 2
          },
          {
            "needId": "checklist:4",
            "type": "checklist",
            "heading": "Night Shifts and Your Health",
            "kind": "items",
            "items": [
              {
                "heading": "",
                "text": "Is the shift fixed, or does it rotate."
              },
              {
                "heading": "",
                "text": "What are the exact start and end times, and is transport provided."
              },
              {
                "heading": "",
                "text": "Is there a day-shift domestic account I can move to later."
              },
              {
                "heading": "",
                "text": "How are weekly offs and leave handled."
              }
            ],
            "sourceSectionId": "night",
            "sourceNeedIndex": 4
          },
          {
            "needId": "checklist:9",
            "type": "checklist",
            "heading": "Positioning: Say Who You Help",
            "kind": "items",
            "items": [
              {
                "heading": "",
                "text": "Proof: a before-and-after (reply time, resolved tickets), one short case note, and one person who will vouch for you."
              },
              {
                "heading": "",
                "text": "First skill to learn: a simple fixed package and a calm price conversation."
              },
              {
                "heading": "",
                "text": "Referrals and follow-up: ask every happy client who else struggles with the same thing, and follow up after each delivery."
              },
              {
                "heading": "",
                "text": "One number to watch: how many conversations turn into a paid trial."
              }
            ],
            "sourceSectionId": "sales-layer",
            "sourceNeedIndex": 9
          }
        ]
      },
      "type": "checklist",
      "title": "Getting in After 12th"
